  {
    "id": "20261101-060139",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Tmall: Kupon tanlangan rangga ham ishlaydimi?",
    "text": "🎟️ <b>TMALL: KUPON TANLAGAN RANGINGIZGA HAM ISHLAYDIMI?</b>\n\n11.11 aksiyasida koftaning barcha ranglari bir xil chegirmaga kirmasligi mumkin.\n\n<b>Qanday tekshiriladi?</b>\n1️⃣ Kofta sahifasida kerakli rangni tanlang.\n2️⃣ Kupon shartini o‘qing.\n3️⃣ To‘lovdan oldingi yakuniy summani ko‘ring.\n4️⃣ Chegirma hisoblanganini tekshiring.\n\nImmensus Post maslahati: tanlagan rangingizga kupon ishlamasa, to‘lovni tasdiqlashga shoshilmang.\n\n<a href=\"https://zjamr.zhanjiang.gov.cn/zmhd/content/post_2213198.html\">Manba</a> · <a href=\"https://www.alibabagroup.com/en-US/document-2047546975867371520\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBJ2rm1iNQfoJXi8R7SEdtVqq437ihAAKIFWsbGaU5V-I7MFyklPOpAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261101-060139/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Tmall: Kupon tanlangan rangga ham ishlaydimi?",
      "angle": "Kofta rangini tanlagach, kupon shartini va to‘lovdan oldingi yakuniy summani tekshiring.",
      "why_now": "11.11 aksiyasida mahsulotning barcha ranglari bir xil chegirmaga kirmasligi mumkin.",
      "research": "**Tekshiruv sanasi: 2026-yil 1-noyabr.** Quyidagi mavzular Xitoy ichki bozori uchun mo‘ljallangan platformalarga asoslangan. Tugmalar va takliflar mahsulotga qarab farq qilishi mumkin. Tmall’ning 11.11 savdosi 20-oktabrda boshlangan; shu sabab narx va kuponlarni tekshirish ayniqsa dolzarb. ([alibabagroup.com](https://www.alibabagroup.com/en-US/document-2047546975867371520?utm_source=openai))\n\n1. **Tmall: Kupon tanlagan rangingizga ham ishlaydimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Masalan, kofta rangini tanlab, kupon shartini va to‘lovdan oldingi yakuniy summani tekshirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Aksiya paytida bir xil mahsulotning barcha ranglari chegirmaga kirmasligi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 10/10. ([zjamr.zhanjiang.gov.cn](https://zjamr.zhanjiang.gov.cn/zmhd/content/post_2213198.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Taobao: Ikki sotuvchidagi narxni qanday adolatli solishtirish kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Bir xil uy-ro‘zg‘or buyumining o‘lchami, materiali va sonini tenglashtirib, keyin yakuniy narxlarni solishtirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** 11.11 takliflarida katta chegirma yozuviga emas, haqiqiy to‘lovga qarash foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([dzswgf.mofcom.gov.cn](https://dzswgf.mofcom.gov.cn/news/43/2026/10/1792993396286.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Pinduoduo: Kiyim matosini suratga qarab emas, qanday tekshirish kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Pijama misolida mahsulot tavsifidan mato tarkibini topish; ma’lumot noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Aksiya suratlari chiroyli ko‘rinsa ham, xaridordan material va tavsifni alohida tekshirish talab etiladi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250618/125e5b0c1e524b1caf82e83e6e0ee5be/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Taobao: Bola uchun o‘yinchoq yoshiga mosligini qayerdan bilish mumkin?**\n   - **Burchak:** O‘yinchoq sahifasidagi tavsiya etilgan yosh va ogohlantirishlarni tekshirish; yosh bolalar uchun mayda ajraladigan qismlardan saqlanish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘ani tanlashda chiroyli ko‘rinishdan oldin yoshga moslikni tekshirish har kuni foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 10/10. ([samr.gov.cn](https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/sj/art/2026/art_f505c48ef72a4883be8e06d240613525.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Pinduoduo: Noto‘g‘ri rang kelsa, sotuvchiga nimani ko‘rsatish kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Buyurtmadagi tanlangan rangni ochish, kelgan buyumni suratga olish va ikkalasini platformadagi sotuvchiga yuborish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Chegirma davrida buyurtma tafsilotlari va yozishmalarni saqlash keyingi murojaatni osonlashtiradi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([yangkeduo.com](https://www.yangkeduo.com/home/help/?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Poizon: Krossovkani qaytarish kerak bo‘lsa, nimasini yechmaslik kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Qaytarish imkoniyati bor-yo‘qligini buyurtma sahifasidan tekshirish va qaror qilguncha himoya belgisini yechmaslik.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Dewu xaridor qoidalarida qaytarish shartlari mahsulotga qarab farqlanishi ko‘rsatilgan. Qoida Xitoydagi Dewu uchun **2026-yil 17-avgustdan** amal qiladi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([agreement.dewu.com](https://agreement.dewu.com/client/view?from=5f83ff7b57c2c0780741fd42&id=127AG56CG1DDA&utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Taobao: Sumkaga telefoningiz sig‘ishini qanday tekshirasiz?**\n   - **Burchak:** Sumka tavsifidagi uzunlik va balandlikni telefonniki bilan solishtirish; o‘lcham ko‘rsatilmagan bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Bitta sumka buyurtma qilayotganda ham suratdagi ko‘rinish haqiqiy o‘lchamni anglatmasligi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([xiongan.gov.cn](https://www.xiongan.gov.cn/20250315/ab18b95acc984e2dbdbfa93482ab4b69/c.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Tmall: Kosmetika olishdan oldin yaroqlilik muddatini qanday tekshirish kerak?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot sahifasidagi muddatni izlash; aniq ko‘rsatilmasa, sotuvchidan qolgan muddatni so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** 11.11 chegirmasi sabab keragidan ortiq xarid qilish mahsulotni ishlatib ulgurmaslikka olib kelishi mumkin.\n   - **Foydali",
